{"id":18863,"date":"2025-02-06T18:18:35","date_gmt":"2025-02-06T18:18:35","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/?page_id=18863"},"modified":"2025-02-06T18:52:58","modified_gmt":"2025-02-06T18:52:58","slug":"dj-anikan","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/dj-anikan\/","title":{"rendered":"DJ Anikan"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><strong>Atlanta\u2019s Master of Memorable Moments<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-18865 size-thumbnail\" src=\"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/Kofi-Osei-Owusu-Headshot-Formal-300x300.png\" alt=\"A man in a vest and tie stands by a railing, tall buildings soaring in the background, embodying the polished essence of professional DJs who bring music entertainment to life.\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/Kofi-Osei-Owusu-Headshot-Formal-300x300.png 300w, https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/Kofi-Osei-Owusu-Headshot-Formal-400x400.png 400w, https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/Kofi-Osei-Owusu-Headshot-Formal-600x600.png 600w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/>With a career that kicked off in 2002, Kofi I, better known as DJ Anikan, is a powerhouse of energy and talent who knows how to light up any event. Born and raised in Atlanta, GA, DJ Anikan brings a Southern charm and an electric vibe that has made him a favorite for over two decades. Hosting events since 2001, his versatile experience spans talent shows, step shows, fashion shows, award ceremonies, and karaoke\u2014proof that he\u2019s no stranger to commanding a crowd.<\/p>\n<p>DJ Anikan\u2019s love for music blossomed in the 90s, and his ability to read a room and create unforgettable moments has been his signature ever since. He describes DJing as \u201cmanipulating the soundtrack of life,\u201d crafting memories through beats and rhythm. With a playlist that spans Redman, Big Boi, Afro Beats, Jazz, and Hip Hop, his diverse taste appeals to crowds of all kinds.<\/p>\n<p><strong>What\u2019s in the Mix?<\/strong><br \/>\nDJ Anikan\u2019s setlist is legendary, with crowd-pleasers like \u201cOMG\u201d by Usher, \u201cDon\u2019t Stop Believing\u201d by Journey, \u201cThis Is How We Do It\u201d by Montell Jordan, \u201cParty In The USA\u201d by Miley Cyrus, and \u201cSwag Surfin.\u201d Whether it\u2019s a corporate gala, school dance, pep rally, or brunch party, he has the perfect track to keep the dance floor alive.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Fun Facts:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>DJ Anikan boasts a six-year residency on Washington DC\u2019s Spirit of Washington, where he was awarded 2019 DJ of the Year.<\/li>\n<li>He\u2019s a go-to entertainer for student voyages, adding a personal touch to every experience.<\/li>\n<li>As a student at the SAE Institute in Atlanta, he\u2019s always evolving his craft.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Beyond the Decks<\/strong><br \/>\nMarried with three kids, DJ Anikan is a family man who loves acting, cartoons, pool, bowling, and catching live music. His vibrant personality and engaging energy make him a hit not just on stage but in every interaction.<\/p>\n<p>If you\u2019re looking for a DJ who can bring a blend of professionalism, fun, and unforgettable vibes, DJ Anikan is the one to call. Let him turn your event into a lasting memory!<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Atlanta\u2019s Master of Memorable Moments With a career that kicked off in 2002, Kofi I, better known as DJ Anikan, is a powerhouse of energy and talent who knows how to light up any event. Born and raised in Atlanta, GA, DJ Anikan brings a Southern charm and an electric vibe that has made him&hellip;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":5,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-18863","page"